BuyStandardClasses:
EVBIT_MODIFY 3
Text(IntroBuyStandardClasses)
CHECK_MONEY
SVAL 0x1 1500
BGE 0x1 0xc 0x1
Text(BuyStandardClassesNoMoney)
ENUF StandardUnlockedFlag
GOTO 0x2
LABEL 0x1
EVBIT_MODIFY 4
SystemText(StandardClassesBuySys)
IfNoSelectedGoto(0x3)
MUSC Song_FaithIsMyPillar
EVBIT_MODIFY 3
Text(BuyStandardClassesYes)
SVAL 0x3 1500
TAKEMONEY
SystemText(StandardClassesBuyYesSys)
MUSC Song_VastLands
GOTO 0x2
LABEL 0x3
EVBIT_MODIFY 3
Text(BuyStandardClassesNo)
ENUF StandardUnlockedFlag
LABEL 0x2
EndEvent

UnlockMagusClasses:
GetUnitStatus(Nathan, Level)
SVAL 0x1 5
BLT 0x1 0xc 0x1 
MUSC Song_FaithIsMyPillar
Text(UnlockMagusClassesYes)
SystemText(UnlockMagusClassesYesSys)
MUSC Song_DrawHeroes
GOTO 0x2
LABEL 0x1
Text(UnlockMagusClassesNo)
ENUF MagusUnlockedFlag
LABEL 0x2
EndEvent


SquareMoveToEnd:
EVBIT_MODIFY 3
SystemText(HubEndPrompt)
IfNoSelectedGoto(0x1)
EVBIT_MODIFY 0
CALL EndingScene
LABEL 0x1
ENUF LocationFlagHirschringSquare
EndEvent


